> Using Tax_rates as T
> Using Types

# Batch wrapper of `TentativeTax` for the Lean differential test

`difftest/lean_rates.mjs` runs this scope once with a few thousand
(taxable income, filing status) pairs instead of one `clerk run` per pair.
Each element is one run of the scope `T.TentativeTax`; the three output lists
are its three outputs, in input order.

```catala
declaration structure RateQuery:
  data taxable_income content money
  data filing_status content Types.FilingStatus

declaration scope TentativeTaxBatch:
  input queries content list of RateQuery
  output rounded_taxable_income content list of money
  output tentative_tax_from_taxable_income content list of money
  output tentative_tax_cumulative_form content list of money

scope TentativeTaxBatch:
  definition rounded_taxable_income equals
    map each q among queries to
      (output of T.TentativeTax with {
        -- taxable_income: q.taxable_income -- filing_status: q.filing_status
      }).rounded_taxable_income
  definition tentative_tax_from_taxable_income equals
    map each q among queries to
      (output of T.TentativeTax with {
        -- taxable_income: q.taxable_income -- filing_status: q.filing_status
      }).tentative_tax_from_taxable_income
  definition tentative_tax_cumulative_form equals
    map each q among queries to
      (output of T.TentativeTax with {
        -- taxable_income: q.taxable_income -- filing_status: q.filing_status
      }).tentative_tax_cumulative_form
```
